+# Main Branch Protection
+
+Protect the repository's default branch with the authoritative CI checks.
+
+## Required Policy
+
+- Changes reach the default branch through a pull request.
+- The pull request branch must be current with the default branch.
+- Every authoritative CI check must pass and be pinned to its expected GitHub
+  App provider.
+- Review conversations must be resolved before merge.
+- Administrators do not bypass the policy.
+- Force pushes and branch deletion remain disabled.
+- Deployment and preview checks are not required unless the quality contract
+  explicitly makes them merge authorities.
+
+Set the approving-review count to zero for a solo-maintainer repository because
+authors cannot approve their own pull requests. Revisit that count when the
+maintainer model changes.
